  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: National Capacity Strengthening on Forestry, Climate Change and Biodiversity aspects in Zambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To solve the lack of adequate representation and participation of technical staff from the department of environment in high level global conferences such as the UN COPs. 
To address the lack of IT equipment in the newly established research unit of the Department of Environment lead to challenges in surveillance, environmental tracking, uninformed planning and, capture and dissemination of information.</narrative>
  </description>
